00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:54.007 size:78% position:39%
-Your only is three.
My youngest is three.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:57.410 line:92%
What is your daughter into

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.380 size:78% position:39% line:92%
