00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
-More than anything.

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:04.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
She loves him.
I don't know, Seth.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:09.189
I don't know what is being three
