00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when I was
working on the show,

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:20.300
she was just alone with her da
with the whole world shut down

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:25.338
just hanging out, so she and him
are like this.

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:27.106 line:92%
And the other day I was like -

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:29.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
